{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55165","headline":"兵要望江南 医方第二十九（十六首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 医方第二十九（十六首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遭毒箭，更兼马汗方。\n大头蝱虫端午取，去翅阴乾爲末霜。\n挑破药敷疮。\n（次用醋打面糊纸压疮口上，即追出毒气也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}